									<div class="px-6 py-4 text-white text-base leading-relaxed">
									 I specialize in tattoo design and development, creating custom tattoo concepts and artwork for clients. I also have experience in web and brand development, building responsive and visually appealing websites using modern technologies. My focus is on delivering high-quality designs and functional websites that meet the unique needs of each client. I also highly enjoy creating custom liveries for cars, trucks, and boats. I have a passion for automotive design and can create eye-catching liveries that reflect your style and personality. Whether you're looking for a bold and aggressive design or a sleek and minimalist look, I can bring your vision to life with custom livery designs that make your vehicle stand out on the road or track. Last but not least, I also love animating and creating motion graphics. I can create dynamic and engaging animations for a variety of purposes, including anime, social media content, and website animations. I use industry-standard software to create high-quality animations that effectively communicate your message and captivate your audience.
